From 8907435688f3ec8815307da6a66078fed3afa4b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:04:31 -0700
Subject: Seal a child header from an ordinary connect result.

Copy the connected StateRoot into the header, set prev_id from the parent
BlockId, and leave the nonce at zero. Reject an out-of-range timestamp, a
compact target DecodeTarget rejects, and a connect result whose StateRoot
is not the child height. This does not search a nonce or submit the header
to lotusd.
---
